body:
I encountered the warning when adding manifestFile reading logic in ManifestGroup.java. The code logic is to build a combined scan with base file and deletion files, something like below:
  private List<ManifestEntry> filterDeletionEntries() {
    List<ManifestEntry> entries = new ArrayList<>();
    for (ManifestFile manifestFile : manifests) {
      ManifestReader reader = ManifestReader.read(manifestFile, io, specsById);
      for (ManifestEntry entry : reader.entries()) {
        if (entry.file().deletionType() == DataFile.DELETION_TYPE) {
          entries.add(entry.copy());
        }
      }
    }

    return entries;
  }
The unit tests passed but I 'd like to confirm whether it is the correct way to iterate manifest entries.
